# Zolto Phase 10 — Interactive Documents Showcase

This document demonstrates the declarative interaction engine introduced in Phase 10:

1. Interactive Forms & Inputs (`@form`, `@text`, `@email`, `@password`, `@select`, `@button`)
2. Quizzes & Self-Assessment (`@quiz`, `@mcq`, `@multi`, `@truefalse`, `@blank`, `@match`)
3. Flashcard Study Decks (`@deck`, `@card`)
4. Live Polls & Tallies (`@poll`)
5. Interactive Checklists (`@tasks`)
6. Interactive Tabs & Accordions (`@tabs`, `@accordion`)

---

## 1. Interactive Form

@form contact {
  @text username required
  label "Username"
  placeholder "Enter your username"

  @email email required
  label "Email Address"
  placeholder "user@example.com"

  @select role {
    @option dev "Developer"
    @option designer "Designer"
    @option manager "Product Manager"
  }

  @switch subscribe
  label "Subscribe to newsletter"

  @button primary "Create Account"
}

---

## 2. Interactive Quiz

@quiz "Computer Science Fundamentals" {

  @mcq "What does CPU stand for?" {
    @correct "Central Processing Unit"
    @choice "Control Processing Unit"
    @choice "Computer Power Unit"

    @hint
    Think about the central element executing instructions.
    @end

    @explain
    The Central Processing Unit performs calculations and executes code.
    @end
  }

  @multi "Select compiled programming languages:" {
    @correct "C++"
    @correct "Rust"
    @choice "Python"
    @choice "JavaScript"
  }

  @truefalse "HTTP status 404 means Not Found."
  answer true

  @blank "Capital of Japan"
  answer "Tokyo"

  @match {
    Linux -> Kernel
    HTML -> Markup
    CSS -> Styling
  }

}

---

## 3. Flashcard Study Deck

@deck CSConcepts {

  @card
    front "Algorithm"
    back "A step-by-step procedure for solving a problem or performing a computation."
  @end

  @card
    front "Complexity"
    back "Big-O notation describes the limiting behavior of a function when the argument tends towards a particular value or infinity."
  @end

  @card
    front "Recursion"
    back "A technique where a function calls itself directly or indirectly."
  @end

}

---

## 4. Interactive Poll

@poll "What is your primary use case for Zolto?" {
  Documentation & Manuals
  Interactive Quizzes & Courses
  Data Dashboards & Analytics
  Vector Graphics & Presentations
}

