## 6. Accordion & Tabs

@accordion {
  @section "Is scripting allowed inside Zolto documents?"
  No. Zolto documents are purely declarative, safe, and deterministic. No arbitrary eval or JavaScript is allowed in source content.
  @/section

  @section "Are Phase 10 interactive elements accessible?"
  Yes! All generated elements include appropriate ARIA roles, labels, keyboard navigation bindings, and focus ring styling.
  @/section
}
